      "side": 1,
      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] **Resource Leak: Multiple `libusb_init` calls**\n`libusb_init(nullptr)` is called unconditionally here. If `initialize()` is called multiple times by the caller, it will increment the libusb reference count multiple times. However, `libusb_exit(nullptr)` is only called once in the destructor. This will lead to a resource leak.\n*Remediation:* Track whether libusb has already been initialized, or move `libusb_init` to the constructor.",
      "revId": "656b174d3c9ed84c1437f3e1b4fd98c8b82106ea",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
